    "title": "Four tornadoes confirmed from recent storms - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By TOM LATEK, Kentucky Today ,\n12 hours ago FRANKFORT, Ky. (KT) – Four tornadoes have been confirmed to have struck Kentucky on Monday night and Tuesday morning, according to the National Weather Service (NWS) offices in Paducah and Louisville. NWS Paducah says the first occurred in Hopkins County, outside Jewel City, shortly before midnight (CT), Monday night.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
